{"title":"原因与证明","comparisons":{"blog-cn_2013_04_26_reason-and-proof_20130507.html":{"from":"blog-cn_2013_04_26_reason-and-proof_20090101.html","to":"blog-cn_2013_04_26_reason-and-proof_20130507.html","from_date":"2009-01-01","to_date":"2013-05-07","counts":{"added":2,"removed":1,"changed":2},"preview":"作者：王垠","html":"<div class=\"diff-block diff-removed\"><span class=\"diff-marker\" aria-hidden=\"true\">−</span><p>作者：王垠</p></div>\n<div class=\"diff-context\">证明</div>\n<div class=\"diff-block diff-changed\"><span class=\"diff-marker\" aria-hidden=\"true\">±</span><div class=\"diff-inline\">几天后我问他，你证明了 STLC 有这个特性，然而你却没有告诉我它“为什么”有这个特性。他神气的看了我一眼：“你不懂吗？”我说：“你的证明我看懂了大部分，可是一个东西具有如此的性质，并不是因为你证明了它。这性质是它天生就有的，不管你是否能证明它。我想知道的是什么让 STLC 具有这个性质，而不只是证明它。”他说：“你问这样的问题有什么意义吗？你需要非常聪明，并且需要经过大量的努力才能想出这样的证明。”<del> 原因</del></div></div>\n<div class=\"diff-block diff-added\"><span class=\"diff-marker\" aria-hidden=\"true\">+</span><h3>原因</h3></div>\n<div class=\"diff-context\">原因</div>\n<div class=\"diff-block diff-changed\"><span class=\"diff-marker\" aria-hidden=\"true\">±</span><div class=\"diff-inline\">过了一段时间，我不仅学会了这个“证明”，而且知道了 STLC 具有如此特性的“原因”。<del> 证明与原因的区别</del></div></div>\n<div class=\"diff-block diff-added\"><span class=\"diff-marker\" aria-hidden=\"true\">+</span><h3>证明与原因的区别</h3></div>"},"blog-cn_2013_04_26_reason-and-proof_20140513.html":{"from":"blog-cn_2013_04_26_reason-and-proof_20130507.html","to":"blog-cn_2013_04_26_reason-and-proof_20140513.html","from_date":"2013-05-07","to_date":"2014-05-13","counts":{"added":1,"removed":0,"changed":0},"preview":"（王垠 yinwang.org 版权所有，未经许可，请勿转载）","html":"<div class=\"diff-block diff-added\"><span class=\"diff-marker\" aria-hidden=\"true\">+</span><p>（王垠 yinwang.org 版权所有，未经许可，请勿转载）</p></div>"},"blog-cn_2013_04_26_reason-and-proof_20140701.html":{"from":"blog-cn_2013_04_26_reason-and-proof_20140513.html","to":"blog-cn_2013_04_26_reason-and-proof_20140701.html","from_date":"2014-05-13","to_date":"2014-07-01","counts":{"added":0,"removed":